    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "This is a VR adventure type game in which you play as a brave pilot who drives a sleigh through a world full of icebergs and snow on a polar expedition.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3065910/extras/1.jpg?t=1727315622\" /></span> <br> <br>The world in the game is harsh, the weather changes frequently, the wind blows the snowflakes towards you, and the visibility in the air is very low. In this difficult environment, you'll need to use your keen observation and reflexes to pay attention to obstacles around you and avoid hitting rocks on the side of the road. At the same time, you also need to control the balance of the sled, otherwise it is easy to overturn.<br>The visuals in the game are very realistic, making you feel like you're in a polar world of ice and snow. You can seem to feel the howling of the wind and the sound of snowflakes, as well as the sound of sleds gliding on the ice, making you even more immersed in this world of ice and snow.<br>All in all, it's a very exciting game that makes you feel the hardships and pleasures of exploring the polar regions. If you like extreme thrills, then this game is not to be missed.<br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3065910/extras/2.jpg?t=1727315622\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How it works:</h2>Move Forward/Backward    \uff1a  L/R-handle up/down<br>Turn   \uff1a  L/R- handle left/right<br>Quit    \uff1a   Menu key<br>Reset   \uff1a   L/R-handle grip",
    "about_the_game": "This is a VR adventure type game in which you play as a brave pilot who drives a sleigh through a world full of icebergs and snow on a polar expedition.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3065910/extras/1.jpg?t=1727315622\" /></span> <br> <br>The world in the game is harsh, the weather changes frequently, the wind blows the snowflakes towards you, and the visibility in the air is very low. In this difficult environment, you'll need to use your keen observation and reflexes to pay attention to obstacles around you and avoid hitting rocks on the side of the road. At the same time, you also need to control the balance of the sled, otherwise it is easy to overturn.<br>The visuals in the game are very realistic, making you feel like you're in a polar world of ice and snow. You can seem to feel the howling of the wind and the sound of snowflakes, as well as the sound of sleds gliding on the ice, making you even more immersed in this world of ice and snow.<br>All in all, it's a very exciting game that makes you feel the hardships and pleasures of exploring the polar regions. If you like extreme thrills, then this game is not to be missed.<br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3065910/extras/2.jpg?t=1727315622\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How it works:</h2>Move Forward/Backward    \uff1a  L/R-handle up/down<br>Turn   \uff1a  L/R- handle left/right<br>Quit    \uff1a   Menu key<br>Reset   \uff1a   L/R-handle grip",
